00:25:52.880 --> 00:25:54.439
Me.

00:25:54.520 --> 00:25:56.079
Your brother.

00:25:56.400 --> 00:25:59.791
Not fucking Aberama Gold
or his punch drunk son.

00:25:59.880 --> 00:26:01.109
But me.

