00:32:10.240 --> 00:32:12.038
Here, have a drink.

00:32:12.920 --> 00:32:14.673
You're gonna need it.

00:32:18.200 --> 00:32:21.830
Thirty five Drumcree Street,
Parkhead, Glasgow...

00:32:21.920 --> 00:32:24.799
Please, please, please, please...

00:32:25.440 --> 00:32:28.672
We have allegiances
