00:34:44.320 --> 00:34:46.039
Mr Shelby, please...

00:34:48.880 --> 00:34:51.634
Our friends in Glasgow
will take care of your family.

00:34:53.560 --> 00:34:55.233
For the curtains.

00:34:57.040 --> 00:35:00.590
Before you, I was
an ordinary working man.

00:35:00.960 --> 00:35:03.191
Yeah, and now you're one of us.

00:35:35.080 --> 00:35:39.836
<i># Blackbird, blackbird
Singing the blues all day</i>

00:35:40.280 --> 00:35:43.671
