Said it's the modern way, Tom...

00:45:22.600 --> 00:45:24.080
It's the modern way.

00:45:24.520 --> 00:45:26.318
Yeah. Yeah.

00:45:27.240 --> 00:45:28.640
Yeah, it's all right.

