00:46:13.920 --> 00:46:16.435
Well, it's my job now.

00:46:17.920 --> 00:46:19.036
I'm back.

00:46:19.160 --> 00:46:21.720
And there's gonna be nobody
dipping their hand with me here,

00:46:22.040 --> 00:46:24.157
